		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Witch-wight, decomposing and rank. Undead thing fueled by revenge and spite.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12 (leather), <strong>HP</strong> 28, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +2 (1d6) or 1 spell +3, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Conjure Zombie (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 14. Summon 1d4 loyal zombies that appear within near. They stay for 5 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Ghoul Spit (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 12. Spit on a target within near, paralyzed for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Snuff (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 12. Extinguish all light sources (even magical) within near.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
